<title>USA: Precision Response offers 4,740,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Precision Response offers 4,740,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Response Corp said Thursday it was publicly offering 4,740,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>There will be 1,500,000 sold by PRC and 3,240,000 will be sold by selling shareholders.  The selling shareholders have granted the Underwriters an option to purchase up to 710,000 additional shares to cover over-allotments, if any.  Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co., Dain Bosworth Incorporated, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. and Furman Selz LLC are the managers for the underwriting group.</p>
<p>Precision Response Corp is a full-service provider of telephone- based customer service and marketing solutions on an outsourced basis to large corporations.</p>
</text>
